# Packages from the AUR, installed after the first boot by afi-aur-setup.
#
# Deliberately excluded from pacstrap: the AUR needs a build environment and an
# unprivileged user, neither of which exists in the live ISO, and a failed build
# must never leave a half-installed system behind.
#
# paru is not listed here. It is the helper that installs this list, so it is
# bootstrapped separately from its own PKGBUILD.
#
# Review the PKGBUILDs before trusting them. One package per line.
#
# A trailing comment on a package's own line is shown as its description in the
# configuration menu. Standalone comments like the ones above are for readers of
# this file and are not displayed.

# Browsers
librewolf-bin              # Firefox without telemetry
microsoft-edge-stable-bin  # Chromium-based, proprietary

# Editors.
#
# visual-studio-code-bin is Microsoft's build, not the OSS `code` package in
# extra. The difference is not cosmetic: only this one can use the Microsoft
# Marketplace, so Copilot, Pylance and the Remote extensions work.
visual-studio-code-bin     # Microsoft build; Marketplace works
cursor-bin                 # AI-first VS Code fork
